<title>USA: MBNA Corp sets 3-for-2 common stock split.</title>
<headline>MBNA Corp sets 3-for-2 common stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBNA Corp said its board approved a three-for-two stock split of its common shares in the form of a dividend, with one additional common share to be issued on October 1 for every two common shares held by stockholders of record on September 15.</p>
</text>
